message: "If you use ToySVG in academic work, cite the specification and this repository."
title: "ToySVG: Benchmarking Geometric Perception and Vector Reconstruction Under Parsimony Budgets"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Riad
    given-names: Mohamed
