date-released: "2026-09-06"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Vuln3rat0r/ToySVG"
url: "https://github.com/Vuln3rat0r/ToySVG"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - vision-language models
  - multimodal llm
  - vlm
  - vector graphics
  - SVG
  - evaluation
  - determinism
  - geometric perception
  - computer vision
abstract: >-
  A deterministic benchmark for figure copying by vision models. A model receives
  one monochrome raster rendered from a hidden SVG path and returns path data
  under a command budget; the score is a pure function of the two paths.
